<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('_tpl/meta', { meta }); %>
    <title>小牛满满</title>
    <style type="text/css">
      .xz-bg-linear {
        --xz-bg-line-color: var(--xz-bg-color, #dcd8d880);
        @apply bg-[linear-gradient(-45deg,var(--xz-bg-line-color)_0_1px,transparent_1px_14px,var(--xz-bg-line-color)_14px_15px,transparent_15px_100%)] bg-size-[20px_20px];
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-stone-100">
    <div class="relative flex min-h-screen flex-col bg-[linear-gradient(15deg,#d1be358f_8px,#f9bc4854,transparent)]">
      <header class="fixed top-0 h-16 w-full bg-olive-50/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex h-full items-center">
          <div class="h-full p-2">
            <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Logo" class="h-full object-contain" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>
      <main class="mt-16 flex-1 p-6 [&_section]:mt-6">
        <template id="tpl-section">
          <section class="rounded-lg bg-white p-6"></section>
        </template>
        <section class="rounded-lg bg-white p-6">
          <h2 class="my-4 text-2xl font-bold">
            欢迎来到
            <span class="text-amber-500 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-out" id="hostname"></span>
          </h2>
        </section>
        <section class="rounded-lg bg-white p-6">
          <div id="ua-normal" class="wrap-break-word"></div>
          <div id="ua-data" class="wrap-break-word"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="rounded-lg bg-white p-6">
          <h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold">关于本站</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700">
            这是一个个人开发学习使用的网站。本站不存储任何用户数据，所有操作仅限于本地环境。
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            请注意，本站仅供个人开发学习使用，不得用于任何非法活动或商业用途。用户应自行承担使用本站的风险，并遵守相关法律法规。
          </p>
        </section>
      </main>
      <footer class="bg-neutral-900 px-6 py-4 text-neutral-200">
        <!-- legal start -->
        <%- include('_tpl/legal'); %>
        <!-- legal end -->
        <!-- copyright start -->
        <%- include('_tpl/copyright'); %>
        <!-- copyright end -->
      </footer>
    </div>
    <script type="module" src="index.app.tsx"></script>
  </body>
</html>
